{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":1,"title":"평균 (반올림)","desc":"<p>숫자 벡터의 평균을 소수 둘째 자리까지 반올림해 돌려주는 <code>mean_rounded(x)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","solution":"mean_rounded <- function(x) {\n  round(mean(x), 2)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>mean()</code>과 <code>round()</code>를 함께 써요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"mean_rounded(c(1, 2, 4))","expected":2.33,"visible":true},{"call":"mean_rounded(5)","expected":5,"visible":true},{"call":"mean_rounded(c(1, 2))","expected":1.5,"visible":false},{"call":"mean_rounded(c(10, 20, 25))","expected":18.33,"visible":false}],"starter":"mean_rounded <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-317"}